WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:05.470
2018's been a huge year for blockbusters,
with three monster earners grossing more than

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:07.979
a billion bucks at the worldwide box office.

00:00:07.979 --> 00:00:12.980
2019 is shaping up to be just as massive,
with more gigantic movies on the way.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:17.010
There's more Star Wars, more Avengers, and
even more evil demon clowns.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.490
But that's just scratching the surface.

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:23.150
Here are the most hotly anticipated movies
of 2019.

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.150
Hellboy

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:28.260
David Harbour unveils his new take on Hellboy
on January 11th, with the Stranger Things

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:32.029
star joining director Neil Marshall for a
grittier take on the horned half-demon.

00:00:32.029 --> 00:00:37.340
Fans should expect a "darker tone" than Guillermo
del Toro's take on Hellboy, with more of a

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:41.780
focus on the character's inner struggles rather
than fighting giant gear monsters with a big

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:42.780
gun.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:46.569
While Harbour's take on Hellboy looks spot
on, the rest of the cast doesn't disappoint

00:00:46.569 --> 00:00:51.920
either, including Milla Jovovich as the villainous
Blood Queen and Ian McShane as Hellboy's adopted

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:54.410
father, a role he has some experience with.

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:57.289
"All great men have mustaches right?"

00:00:57.289 --> 00:00:59.429
"Yeah but real men actually grow them, huh?"

00:00:59.429 --> 00:01:01.700
"You know I have a hormone disorder!"

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.180
"Ohhhh!"

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:05.440
Captain Marvel

00:01:05.449 --> 00:01:10.170
Marvel's first female-led superhero saga will
be long overdue when it hits theaters on March

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.000
8th, but the movie is shaping up to be worth
the wait.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.689
Captain Marvel has Academy Award winner Brie
Larson as Carol Danvers, and Marvel promises

00:01:17.689 --> 00:01:20.800
she'll be "as powerful a character as [they've]
ever put in a movie."

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:22.600
That means she's strong.

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:23.600
How strong is she?

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:24.880
"She's so, so strong.

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.500
She can move planets."

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:30.590
There's also some impressive talent behind
the scenes, with writers behind the Tomb Raider

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:34.869
reboot, Guardians of the Galaxy, and even
Inside Out all lending a hand to bring Captain

00:01:34.869 --> 00:01:36.560
Marvel to life.

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.009
Spider-Man: Far From Home

00:01:38.009 --> 00:01:42.250
Tom Holland's Spider-Man is set to continue
his adventures in a second standalone film

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:43.520
out July 5th.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.840
Spider-Man: Homecoming was super-successful
with both critics and fans, and the follow-up

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:50.570
isn't messing with Marvel's winning formula.

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:54.939
Director Jon Watts is back to helm the web-slinger's
next adventure, and you can expect most of

00:01:54.939 --> 00:01:57.320
Homecoming's excellent cast to make a return.

00:01:57.320 --> 00:02:01.350
We don't know much about the plot of Far From
Home, but we do know Spider-Man will face

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.520
off against Mysterio, the villain played by
Jake Gyllenhaal.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:08.550
Well, that's assuming that Spider-Man is actually,
y'know, back from the dead.

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:10.269
Speaking of which...

00:02:10.269 --> 00:02:11.519
Avengers 4

00:02:11.519 --> 00:02:15.390
The fourth Avengers film will mark the end
of Marvel's Phase 3 when it's released on

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:18.220
May 3rd, which means you should get your tissues
ready.

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:23.140
With many of the contracts for Marvel's biggest
names expiring, Avengers 4 will probably feature

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.840
at least a few major character deaths — the
permanent kind, this time.

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:31.750
If the studio continues its no-holds-barred
approach established in Infinity War, Avengers

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:37.120
4 is sure to be both completely epic and ridiculously
devastating, ending several storylines set

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:42.010
up in past films while also getting things
ready for whatever's coming next.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:43.720
John Wick 3: Parabellum

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:48.049
Keanu Reeves' puppy-loving hitman is coming
back to theaters on May 17th for John Wick

00:02:48.049 --> 00:02:49.580
3: Parabellum.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:53.680
Following the bloodbath of the last movie,
Wick is on the run with a $14 million dollar

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:55.500
global contract on his head.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:59.890
Lots of familiar faces are set to return,
along with new additions like Halle Berry

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.480
as the mysterious Sofia.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:05.500
The third installment in the action-packed,
insane-assassin franchise features the same

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:10.000
writer-director team, so if you love all things
Wick, expect more of the same to come back

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.130
the third time around.

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:13.440
"I'm thinkin' I'm back!"

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:16.049
It: Chapter Two

00:03:16.049 --> 00:03:20.430
Pennywise the Dancing Clown will make his
terrifying return to the big screen on September

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:21.430
6th.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:25.980
The first film followed a group of dangerously
unsupervised kids known as the Losers' Club

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:28.280
as they dealt with an ancient evil being.

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:31.970
The sequel will focus on those same kids,
27 years later.

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:36.010
Now adults, they return to Derry to deal with
the return of the child-chomping clown.

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:40.550
After the first film's massive success, it
was easy to land big name stars to play the

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:45.470
adult Losers, including Jessica Chastain,
James McAvoy, and Bill Hader.

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.959
Here's hoping they all make it out alive.

00:03:47.959 --> 00:03:50.080
Wonder Woman 1984

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:54.990
Wonder Woman is the DCEU's best-performing
film-to-date in the U.S., so it makes sense

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:57.569
that Warner Bros. quickly ordered a sequel.

00:03:57.569 --> 00:04:03.599
Wonder Woman 1984, due out November 1st, will
bring back director Patty Jenkins, who's also

00:04:03.599 --> 00:04:05.290
co-writing the script.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:10.030
While plot details have been kept tightly
under wraps, we know that Wonder Woman 1984

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:13.450
found a way to bring back Chris Pine's beloved
Steve Trevor.

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:18.320
The film will also feature Kristen Wiig as
the central baddie Cheetah, and she's no stranger

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.240
to playing cat ladies.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:21.570
"I'm Furonica.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:24.979
It's like Veronica, but how a cat would say
it."

00:04:24.979 --> 00:04:30.460
So look forward to more action, fun, romance,
and bitter comic-book rivalries.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.180
Star Wars: Episode IX

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:36.570
There've been some shake-ups behind the scenes
of Star Wars: Episode IX, with Lucasfilm dropping

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:41.050
Jurassic World director Colin Trevorrow a
few months before production was set to begin.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:45.490
Good thing they found someone who's definitely
qualified to take over: The Force Awakens'

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:50.690
J.J. Abrams is returning to write and direct
the trilogy finale, due out December 20th.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:55.229
Episode IX's plot is still a mystery, but
all the expected major players are set to

00:04:55.229 --> 00:04:55.740
return.

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:56.740
"Essa embarrassing!"

00:04:57.229 --> 00:04:59.800
Okay, well, all the other major players.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:05.110
But we can look forward to Billy Dee Williams
reprising his role as fan favorite Lando Calrissian.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:11.120
The late Carrie Fisher will also appear, via
unused footage from The Force Awakens.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.120
Joker

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.860
And then there's the wild card.

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:18.620
An Elseworlds-style Joker origin movie starring
the brilliantly weird Joaquin Phoenix is now

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:22.810
officially for real, with shooting scheduled
to start by the end of 2018.

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:27.960
This reportedly "darker and more experimental"
take on Mr. J is going to be

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:31.730
co-written and directed by The Hangover's
Todd Phillips, with the Clown Prince of Crime

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:34.750
expected to hit theaters on October 4th, 2019.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:39.639
Warner Bros. describes the script as "a gritty
character study, but also a broader cautionary

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:40.639
tale."

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:42.600
Sounds like no laughing matter.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:45.180
(maniacal laughing)

